# Origin of Metalbending, second mode: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains indestructible until end of
# turn." In response to Bot2's Damnation (destroy all creatures) on turn 4, Bot1 aims it at Hercules, Prince of Power: the
# counter makes it a 4/4 and indestructible lets it survive the Damnation (CR 702.12b), while Bot1's Ornithopter and Bot2's
# Elvish Mystic die. Bot2's Mystic is refused as the target (beside Hercules, the positive control). Once the turn ends
# indestructible is gone, but the counter stays.

